{"surah":54,"ayahs":["ٱ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">قْ</span>تَرَبَتِ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>سَّاعَةُ وَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">نشَ</span>قَّ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْقَمَرُ","وَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_ghunnah\">إِن يَ</span>رَوْ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-slnt\">اْ</span> ءَايَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_ghunnah\">ةً يُ</span>عْرِضُو<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-slnt\">اْ</span> وَيَقُولُو<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-slnt\">اْ</span> سِحْ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_ghunnah\">رٌ مُّ</span>سْتَمِرٌّ","وَكَذَّبُو<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-slnt\">اْ</span> وَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>تَّبَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">عُوٓ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-slnt\">اْ</span> أَهْ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">وَآ</span>ءَهُمْ‌ۚ وَكُلُّ أَمْ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_ghunnah\">رٍ مُّ</span>سْتَقِرٌّ","وَلَقَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">دْ</span> <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">جَآ</span>ءَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_shafawi\">هُم مِّ</span>نَ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-iqlab\">نۢ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">بَآ</span>ءِ مَا فِيهِ مُزْدَجَرٌ","حِكْمَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-iqlab\">ةُۢ </span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">بَٰ</span>لِغَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">ةٌ‌ۖ فَ</span>مَا تُغْنِ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">نُّ</span>ذُرُ","فَتَوَلَّ عَنْهُمْ‌ۘ يَوْمَ يَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">دْ</span>عُ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>دَّاعِ إ