eed-ikhafa\">نزِ</span>عُ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">نَّ</span>اسَ كَأَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">نَّ</span>هُمْ أَعْجَازُ نَخْ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_ghunnah\">لٍ مُّ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">نقَ</span>عِرٍ","فَكَيْفَ كَانَ عَذَابِى وَنُذُرِ","وَلَقَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">دْ</span> يَسَّرْنَا <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْقُرْءَانَ لِلذِّكْرِ فَهَلْ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_ghunnah\">مِن مُّ</span>دَّكِرٍ","كَذَّبَتْ ثَمُودُ بِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">نُّ</span>ذُرِ","فَقَا<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">لُوٓ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-slnt\">اْ</span> أَبَشَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_ghunnah\">رًا مِّ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">نَّ</span>ا <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">وَٰ</span>حِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_ghunnah\">دًا نَّ</span>تَّبِعُهُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">ۥٓ</span> إِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">نَّآ</span> إِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_wo_ghunnah\">ذًا لَّ</span>فِى ضَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">لَٰ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_ghunnah\">لٍ وَ</span>سُعُرٍ","أَءُلْقِىَ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>ذِّكْرُ عَلَيْهِ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-iqlab\">مِنۢ بَ</span>يْنِنَا بَلْ هُوَ كَذَّابٌ أَشِرٌ","سَيَعْلَمُونَ غَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_ghunnah\">دًا مَّ</span>نِ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْكَذَّابُ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَشِرُ","إِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">نَّ</span>ا مُرْسِلُو<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-slnt\